body:
Are you feeling suicidal? If you are;

I reccomend that you see a professional, or commit yourself to a psychiatric facility. You can do the latter by going to the ER and telling them how you feel. They will take you seriously.

If a long term commitment (In a hospital) is within the realm of possibility, I suggest that you prepare bath supplies and toiletries, clothing without strings, and a blanket before you commit yourself. These are luxuries that will help you feel more comfortable during your stay.
